{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年60歲的兩屆視后鄧萃雯，近日接受好友鄭丹瑞訪問。</p><p>在節目中，雯女罕有剖白人生最大低潮，重提1998年金融風暴買樓損手、慘蝕一半身家的痛苦經歷，直指當年價值觀瞬間崩潰，亦因此令她在30多歲時重投信仰。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:13:38.284655+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T05:07:02.620506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:07:02.620506+00:00","content_hash":"535ea3feb9efc55ba8c8de404307b69e3a01be9abbffd29c2273268af064beaa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}